{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03249","headline":"放白鹇篇 · 宋之问","name":"放白鹇篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人赠我绿绮琴，兼致白鹇鸟。\n琴是峄山桐，鸟出吴溪中。\n我心松石清霞里，弄此幽弦不能已。\n我心河海白云垂，怜此珍禽空自知。\n着书晚下麒麟阁，幼稚骄痴候门乐。\n乃言物性不可违，白鹇愁慕刷毛衣。\n玉徽闭匣留爲念，六翮开笼任尔飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}